InkFeed (MIT License)
https://github.com/jrohde/InkFeed

Build, launcher and packaging patterns were adapted from InkFeed: the CMake ARM toolchain block
and manual moc/rcc steps (cmake/sdk.cmake, cmake/qt_manual.cmake), the rotation/devicePixelRatio
stage (qml/Main.qml; the flat button of the first versions was replaced in 1.10.0 by controls written for this project),
the InkView glue in app/, the PocketBook launcher script
(platform/pocketbook/pbnotes.app) and the packaging script (scripts/package-device.sh). The way the
default web browser is started from a link (OpenBook with BROWSER_FOR_AUTH, app/device_bridge.cpp)
follows InkFeed's browser launch.

